zonaro-nautilus-extensions (1.0-0~zonaro1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian/Launchpad packaging of the zonaro fork.
  * One binary package per extension, plus common infrastructure and an
    "all" metapackage.
  * Extensions are installed under /usr/share/zonaro-nautilus-extensions and
    linked per user by /usr/bin/zonaro-nautilus-link via XDG autostart.
  * hidden-dim-all conflicts with and replaces hidden-dim-icon.

 -- Kaizonaro <zonaro@outlook.com>  Tue, 06 Oct 2026 21:50:07 -0300
